{"identity_key": "bilibili:1264089719402135568", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1264089719402135568", "content": "100% 好评！《音序核心》新品节总结！\n超级无敌感谢大家在 Steam 新品节、Unreal Fest 和北京核聚变期间，在线上和线下游玩《音序核心》！\n目前游戏 Demo 已收获了 100% 好评率，愿望单数量也成功翻倍，感谢每一位支持我们的玩家，也谢谢大家认真留下的反馈和建议~\n新品节结束，但 Demo 还可以继续玩！我们会继续打磨 Demo，优化游戏体验和新手引导，也欢迎大家继续反馈bug及建议。🔥\n\n11月，我们还会带着《音序核心》去上海 WePlay！现场有周边可以领，光栅美少女飞行员真的超！好！看！北京核聚变已经收获一大波喜爱啦！❤\n\n最后，悄悄放出一位新头目——\n这次又要面对什么新挑战了？！ 👀", "publisher": "GamirrorGames", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1264089719402135568", "published_at": "2026-10-28T03:13:43+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/79878a0a9fcb6ed2a3fe54db93278903298686071.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/b9421b3e1a17f0f4145a329dfba46403298686071.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/2ae2bf50e754a9f8fee447db735dd416298686071.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_298686071", "uid": "298686071", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "100% 好评！《音序核心》新品节总结！", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 14, "retweets": 1, "replies": 0}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
