{"identity_key": "bilibili:1264162746725826599", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1264162746725826599", "content": "早上看到最近血库缺血的新闻，路边有献血车我顺便就去献了个血。然后抽象的事情发生了，验血后我才知道我真正的血型，我妈居然记错了我的血型！四十年了，她居然一直记的是错的，我也弄错了四十年[笑哭][笑哭][笑哭]", "publisher": "被炒的炒饭", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1264162746725826599", "published_at": "2026-10-28T07:57:06+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/1bc50d1e71da1b3236af74ee842d817416302815.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/d655042ff4dd925e6fc3f5fe058a16c716302815.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_16302815", "uid": "16302815", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 298, "retweets": 0, "replies": 92}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
